          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000014\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The basket-and-rope rescue is easy to follow and ends with the rabbit warm, though the hungry child’s sacrifice is only briefly developed.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000028\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The basket-and-rope rescue is easy to follow and ends with the rabbit warm, though the hungry child’s sacrifice is only briefly developed.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000058\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Sam shares food to coax the frightened rabbit into a lowered basket and brings it inside to rest; the actions are clear but repetitive.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000023\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The kitten is coaxed into a basket and brought safely indoors; the ending is concrete, though the prose repeats the rescue steps plainly.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000036\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The kitten is coaxed into a basket and brought safely indoors; the ending is concrete, though the prose repeats the rescue steps plainly.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000017\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Ben gives up his bread to coax the puppy into a lowered basket, then wraps it warmly; the sequence is clear but minimally dramatized.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000053\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Sam shares bread to lure the rabbit into the lowered basket, then shelters it indoors; the simple causal sequence is coherent and complete.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000021\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The puppy’s fear prompts a food-and-basket rescue, ending with it resting in warmth; the story is clear but told in a repetitive, event-like style.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Nora steadies a ladder while Dad lifts the kitten down, then wraps it warmly; this is a complete, clear rescue, though the resolution is abrupt.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000048\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The frightened rabbit is coaxed into a lowered basket and carried indoors to rest; the events make sense, but the plain repetition limits the storytelling.\",\"group_id\":0}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":2,\"causal_path\":2,\"ending\":2,\"language\":1,\"overall\":2},\"diversity_evidence\":\"Most entries repeat the same problem and solution: a shivering animal stranded on a high ledge is lured with bread into a rope-lowered basket and brought inside (s000014, s000028, s000058, s000023, s000036, s000017, s000053, s000021, s000048). s000034 makes a small causal variation, using a steadied ladder instead. The animal, child, and parent names change, but the endings and language remain very similar. This describes only this sample, not the whole generator.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"group_id\":0,\"summary\":\"A child shares bread to coax a frightened animal from a high ledge into a rope-lowered basket, then brings it indoors to rest warmly.\"},{\"group_id\":1,\"summary\":\"A child steadies a ladder while a parent climbs up and lifts the stranded kitten down, which is then wrapped warmly.\"}] }",
